g=[(0,10,'Prepare the plate and measure oats','Flatten parchment on the plate, retrieve and place a mixing bowl, open the oat canister, retrieve a small spoon, transfer spoonfuls of oats and close the canister.','Provides the lined surface and measured oat base for the bars.'),(11,18,'Combine the dry ingredients','Lift the ingredient dish, spoon its crumbly brown contents into the oats, return the dish, stir the dry mixture and scrape the small spoon.','Distributes the additional dry ingredient throughout the oat base.'),(19,30,'Add peanut butter and honey','Retrieve and open the peanut butter jar, scoop and scrape peanut butter into the bowl, open and squeeze the honey bottle, return it, put the small spoon down and fetch a larger spoon.','Adds the visible sticky ingredients and obtains the utensil used to bind the mixture.'),(31,38,'Mix and shape the oat slab','Mix and press the ingredients with the large spoon, scrape it with fingers, transfer two portions to the parchment, flatten and shape the slab, then put the spoon down in the bowl.','Forms a compact slab that can be chilled and divided into bars.'),(39,47,'Chill the oat slab and return it','Lift the lined plate, carry it to the freezer, open the door, place the plate inside, close and wait, reopen and retrieve it, return it to the counter and take a knife.','Briefly chills the shaped slab and returns it to the cutting area.'),(48,57,'Cut and carry the oat bars','Steady the slab, make parallel knife cuts and reposition the blade to separate four bars, place the knife in the bowl, then lift and carry the lined plate toward the nearby table.','Divides the slab into individual bars and moves them to the serving surface.')]
